MR.Liou系統元代碼（Mr.L-Code）定義文件
作者：MR.Liou
版本：v1.0 元代碼規範

一、語法基礎規則（Syntax Rules）
1. 定義粒子（Define Particle）:
Particle := { name: String, type: String, weight: Float }

2. 粒子集合（Particle Set）:
ParticleSet := [Particle1, Particle2, Particle3, ...]

3. 粒子映射場域（Particle Routing）:
Route(P, μ) := assign Particle P to Field μ

4. 張量結構生成（Tensor Structure Generation）:
Tensor := { particles: ParticleSet, rhythm: String, persona: String }

5. 維度投射運算（Dimension Projection）:
DimensionProjection(d: Int) := map Tensor structure into d-dimensional space

6. 語義塌縮生成結果（Semantic Collapse Generation）:
Collapse(J) := Generate final semantic structure or entity named J

二、範例元代碼結構（Example Meta-code Structure）
{
  "Particles": [
    {"name": "Emotion", "type": "Curiosity", "weight": 0.8},
    {"name": "Freq", "type": "432Hz", "weight": 0.7},
    {"name": "Form", "type": "Spiral", "weight": 0.9},
    {"name": "Intent", "type": "Explore", "weight": 0.85}
  ],
  "Routing": [
    {"particle": "Emotion", "field": "MindField"},
    {"particle": "Freq", "field": "WaveField"},
    {"particle": "Form", "field": "MatterField"},
    {"particle": "Intent", "field": "MindField"}
  ],
  "Tensor": {
    "particles": ["Emotion", "Freq", "Form", "Intent"],
    "rhythm": "4:2:1",
    "persona": "Explorer"
  },
  "DimensionProjection": {
    "targetDimension": 3
  },
  "Collapse": {
    "target": "DynamicExplorationShell"
  }
}

三、運算流程元代碼範例（Computational Flow Meta-code）
Initialize ParticleSet
For each Particle in ParticleSet:
    Identify μ (field) using Particle type
    Route(Particle, μ)

Generate TensorStructure:
    Apply rhythm and persona factors to ParticleSet

Perform DimensionProjection:
    Tensor → project into targetDimension (2D, 3D, 4D...)

If Semantic Stability Threshold is met:
    Collapse structure → Output entity J

四、標準化語法與JSON介面示範
語法示範JSON：
{
  "meta": {
    "author": "MR.Liou",
    "version": "1.0"
  },
  "definition": {
    "particles": [
      {"name": "Persona", "type": "Innovator", "weight": 0.95},
      {"name": "Form", "type": "Helix", "weight": 0.88}
    ],
    "routing": [
      {"particle": "Persona", "field": "MindField"},
      {"particle": "Form", "field": "MatterField"}
    ],
    "tensor": {
      "particles": ["Persona", "Form"],
      "rhythm": "3:1",
      "persona": "Innovative"
    },
    "dimensionProjection": {
      "targetDimension": 4
    },
    "collapse": {
      "target": "AdaptiveInnovationStructure"
    }
  }
}

